repository-code: "https://github.com/propiter/agent-containment-lab"
abstract: >-
  A sealed-lab research harness to study emergent multi-agent (LLM) coordination
  and containment, reproducing the dynamics of the 2026 OpenAI–Hugging Face
  incident against self-hosted, intentionally-vulnerable targets on an air-gapped
  network. Defensive / AI-safety use only.
